WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:40.759
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.259 --> 01:43.590
[Episode 32]

02:18.700 --> 02:20.829
No peeking at things we shouldn't see.

02:30.870 --> 02:32.670
There are still people outside.

02:33.630 --> 02:34.190
I know.

02:42.360 --> 02:44.210
I'm actually fine now.

02:45.800 --> 02:46.470
Then you

02:48.960 --> 02:50.420
may go back and rest early.

02:51.400 --> 02:51.840
Okay.

02:52.030 --> 02:52.690
Well, then,

02:52.960 --> 02:54.420
see you tomorrow morning.

02:55.030 --> 02:56.490
See you tomorrow morning.

03:02.030 --> 03:03.490
See you tomorrow morning.

03:18.840 --> 03:19.300
Junior,

03:19.540 --> 03:20.280
rest early.

03:24.190 --> 03:25.310
Who is your junior?

04:08.490 --> 04:11.270
[Tianyuan Sect]

04:19.680 --> 04:20.510
Senior Brother Bai,

04:20.510 --> 04:21.170
I'm coming.

04:23.680 --> 04:24.870
I bought this down the mountain.

04:24.870 --> 04:25.800
Senior Brother Bai,

04:25.800 --> 04:27.130
it's just for you to try.

04:27.680 --> 04:28.280
Thank you.

04:32.750 --> 04:33.720
The Sect Leader said

04:33.720 --> 04:35.730
we have distinguished guests today.

04:35.730 --> 04:36.680
He took the seniors

04:36.680 --> 04:38.280
to Guiyuan Hall in the front.

04:45.870 --> 04:46.950
Senior Brother Bai,

04:46.950 --> 04:47.880
you are injured.

04:48.630 --> 04:49.920
The Sect Leader must not have wanted
to disturb you,

04:49.920 --> 04:51.120
so he didn't tell you.

04:52.830 --> 04:53.430
I know.

05:01.680 --> 05:03.560
Senior Bai! Senior Bai!

05:13.430 --> 05:14.090
Senior Bai,

05:14.360 --> 05:16.620
have you been recovering well recently?

05:16.780 --> 05:17.720
Thank you for your concern.

05:17.720 --> 05:19.070
I'm almost fully recovered.

05:19.070 --> 05:20.240
You still need to be careful.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.190
With vital energy damaged,

05:21.190 --> 05:22.800
your body needs time to recover slowly.

05:22.800 --> 05:23.600
Don't rush it.

05:23.720 --> 05:24.630
Yes, I know.

05:26.510 --> 05:27.360
Senior Bai,

05:27.510 --> 05:28.640
are you busy lately?

05:29.430 --> 05:30.390
Not really.

05:33.430 --> 05:35.270
The Sect Leader has guests today,

05:35.270 --> 05:37.040
and the Outer Courtyard is short of hands.

05:37.040 --> 05:39.040
If you are free, Senior Bai,

05:39.240 --> 05:40.190
would you like

05:40.920 --> 05:41.870
to lend a hand?

05:45.159 --> 05:46.159
If it's inconvenient,

05:46.159 --> 05:47.040
please just forget it.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.370
It's not inconvenient.

05:48.600 --> 05:49.159
Really?

05:50.350 --> 05:51.310
That's great.

05:51.659 --> 05:53.920
Thank you for lending a hand, Senior Bai.

05:54.120 --> 05:54.720
Farewell.

05:55.630 --> 05:56.070
Wait!

05:56.090 --> 05:57.130
What do you mean?

06:06.070 --> 06:07.000
Fetching water?

06:07.310 --> 06:09.240
Senior Brother Bai is
the Sect Leader's leading disciple.

06:09.240 --> 06:10.640
How can he do such chores?

06:11.430 --> 06:12.430
Junior Han,

06:12.680 --> 06:14.240
this is not what I can control.

06:14.240 --> 06:16.040
I only know that everyone who comes here

06:16.040 --> 06:17.070
has to do this job.

06:18.040 --> 06:20.300
Senior Bai, if you're unwilling to do it,

06:20.310 --> 06:21.870
you can go find Manager Yu

06:22.040 --> 06:22.840
and complain.

06:25.920 --> 06:26.320
You...

06:56.120 --> 06:57.250
Senior Brother Bai,

06:57.390 --> 06:58.190
I'm so tired.

06:58.600 --> 07:00.750
Let's rest a bit
before going up the mountain.

07:00.750 --> 07:01.390
Alright.

07:01.920 --> 07:02.380
Come on.

07:15.390 --> 07:17.320
Actually, you didn't have to come.

07:18.310 --> 07:20.040
You are from Suxin Hall, right?

07:20.160 --> 07:21.560
You can take care of herbs

07:21.680 --> 07:23.340
and don't need to fetch water.

07:23.800 --> 07:24.630
At Suxin Hall,

07:24.950 --> 07:26.310
I just do some odd jobs.

07:26.750 --> 07:27.600
They never let me get involved

07:27.600 --> 07:29.060
in those weighty matters.

07:30.430 --> 07:31.360
I sneaked out,

07:31.360 --> 07:32.420
and no one noticed.

07:32.920 --> 07:33.750
I'd rather follow you, Senior,

07:33.750 --> 07:34.950
and fetch water here.

07:36.159 --> 07:37.620
When did you join the Sect?

07:37.950 --> 07:39.610
I'm from Quan County, Luzhou.

07:39.720 --> 07:41.250
My father is a businessman.

07:41.600 --> 07:43.430
When my family found out
I had immortal perception,

07:43.430 --> 07:44.720
they sold 2 shops

07:45.360 --> 07:46.510
and pulled every string they could

07:46.510 --> 07:48.040
to send me to Tianyuan Sect.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.180
Come to think of it,

07:51.190 --> 07:52.520
it's been over 10 years.

07:52.920 --> 07:54.360
Even though it's been more than 10 years,

07:54.360 --> 07:55.960
my skills haven't improved.

07:56.120 --> 07:58.360
My cultivation hasn't progressed either.

07:58.360 --> 07:59.000
Actually,

08:00.040 --> 08:01.970
it's not too late for you to go back.

08:02.430 --> 08:04.000
That would be so embarrassing!

08:04.000 --> 08:05.680
They all think I'm living a dream life

08:05.680 --> 08:06.760
at Tianyuan Sect.

08:07.450 --> 08:08.240
If I go back now

08:08.240 --> 08:09.570
looking this pathetic,

08:09.680 --> 08:11.120
they'll definitely say that

08:11.120 --> 08:11.870
it would've been better

08:11.870 --> 08:15.000
if I didn't have immortal perception
in the first place.

08:31.630 --> 08:32.740
By the way, Senior Brother Bai,

08:32.740 --> 08:33.960
do you know why our sect

08:33.960 --> 08:35.559
has to carry water every day?

08:36.200 --> 08:36.929
I don't know.

08:37.549 --> 08:39.140
Ordinary disciples entering the Sect

08:39.140 --> 08:40.720
have to carry water for 3 years first.

08:40.720 --> 08:42.030
You're a Heavenly Talent disciple,

08:42.030 --> 08:43.710
so you definitely
haven't experienced this.

08:43.710 --> 08:45.060
I heard that this mountain of ours

08:45.060 --> 08:46.460
used to be a blessed place

08:47.000 --> 08:47.870
specifically picked

08:47.870 --> 08:49.000
by the sect founder.

08:50.240 --> 08:51.340
But decades ago,

08:51.750 --> 08:53.550
after the Battle of Pinghu,

08:53.840 --> 08:55.240
for some unknown reason,

08:55.270 --> 08:56.750
the mountain ridges and streams

08:56.750 --> 08:57.810
quickly withered,

08:57.870 --> 08:59.120
and the vegetation dried up,

08:59.120 --> 09:00.320
leaving no vitality.

09:00.840 --> 09:02.960
Yet the foot
of the mountain wasn't much affected.

09:02.960 --> 09:04.670
The Sect Leader at the time said

09:04.670 --> 09:06.750
this was the blessed land
handpicked by the founder.

09:06.750 --> 09:07.960
We couldn't abandon it.

09:07.960 --> 09:08.910
So since then,

09:09.240 --> 09:10.390
newly entered disciples

09:10.390 --> 09:12.590
all have to carry water up the mountain.

09:18.390 --> 09:19.390
Who is that person?

09:19.390 --> 09:19.790
Him?

09:20.200 --> 09:21.260
You don't know him?

09:21.440 --> 09:23.630
The Sect's Senior Brother Bai Zongying.

09:23.630 --> 09:24.270
Bai Zongying?

09:24.270 --> 09:24.660
Yeah.

09:24.830 --> 09:26.150
Isn't he a Heavenly Talent disciple,

09:26.150 --> 09:27.440
a Nascent Soul cultivator?

09:27.440 --> 09:28.870
Things have changed.

09:29.190 --> 09:29.790
Look at us.

09:29.870 --> 09:31.790
We only need to carry water
for a couple of years.

09:31.790 --> 09:32.650
But look at him.

09:32.710 --> 09:33.510
Who knows how many more years

09:33.510 --> 09:34.960
he'll have to carry it in the future?

09:34.960 --> 09:35.870
What are you saying?

09:35.870 --> 09:36.930
Let's go, let's go.

09:41.960 --> 09:43.030
Senior Brother Bai,

09:43.030 --> 09:44.390
they're talking nonsense.

09:44.390 --> 09:45.320
Don't mind them.

10:10.510 --> 10:11.640
Senior Brother Bai,

10:11.910 --> 10:13.440
I heard that in the mortal world
in the past,

10:13.440 --> 10:14.550
there was something

10:14.550 --> 10:16.750
called the Wooden Ox and Gliding Horse.

10:16.840 --> 10:18.270
It was made by ordinary human artisans

10:18.270 --> 10:19.670
through craftsmanship.

10:19.790 --> 10:21.600
With that thing to deliver goods,

10:21.600 --> 10:23.550
even crossing mountains
was like walking on flat ground.

10:23.550 --> 10:25.280
Unfortunately, it's lost now.

10:25.670 --> 10:27.150
If we had that thing,

10:27.480 --> 10:29.140
how much effort could we save?

10:32.430 --> 10:33.200
Why are you

10:34.080 --> 10:36.080
mixed up with demonic cultivators?

10:36.240 --> 10:37.150
Your sect ordered you to hunt down

10:37.150 --> 10:38.960
people from the Wushuang Society,

10:38.960 --> 10:40.560
and you just blindly obeyed.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.920
Have you ever read that text?

10:43.050 --> 10:44.320
Have you ever spoken
to the demonic cultivators

10:44.320 --> 10:45.250
you just called?

10:45.290 --> 10:46.720
Do you know why they wanted

10:46.720 --> 10:47.850
to copy those books?

10:49.600 --> 10:50.530
Someone like you

10:51.370 --> 10:52.480
will never understand

10:52.480 --> 10:54.080
what they truly want.

10:58.510 --> 11:02.250
[Sihe Library]

11:31.120 --> 11:32.250
Will you play or not?

11:45.150 --> 11:46.320
I lost again.

11:48.440 --> 11:49.150
Come on.

11:49.150 --> 11:50.630
I can't control anything.

11:54.960 --> 11:55.890
I'm not playing.

11:56.710 --> 11:58.310
Don't be such a sore loser.

11:58.720 --> 12:00.170
I only have this much money.

12:00.170 --> 12:00.960
I wouldn't even

12:00.960 --> 12:02.030
buy myself a new pair of boots,

12:02.030 --> 12:03.490
and I lost it all to you two.

12:05.270 --> 12:05.730
Come on.

12:05.860 --> 12:07.150
Let me see what cards you have.

12:07.150 --> 12:08.210
You never blocked.

12:08.440 --> 12:09.390
Don't look.

12:10.790 --> 12:12.440
You play badly and even blame me.

12:12.440 --> 12:12.770
Wait,

12:12.910 --> 12:14.770
doesn't she usually
listen to you the most?

12:14.770 --> 12:15.440
Why does she show

12:15.440 --> 12:17.240
no mercy to you at the card table?

12:17.510 --> 12:19.110
Sheng usually listens to me,

12:19.390 --> 12:22.190
but she doesn't go easy on anyone
at the card table.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.190
What's wrong?

12:23.630 --> 12:24.290
Let me play.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.090
You can play?

12:26.630 --> 12:27.960
I've watched for a while

12:28.090 --> 12:29.800
and pretty much know how to play.

12:29.800 --> 12:30.290
Okay.

12:55.390 --> 12:56.190
Pay up, pay up.

13:03.320 --> 13:04.780
Give me the money. Come on.

13:20.460 --> 13:21.390
I'm not playing.

13:23.020 --> 13:24.080
Pay first, come on.

13:28.030 --> 13:30.000
Don't stop playing. Let's keep going.

13:30.000 --> 13:31.600
I haven't had enough fun yet.

13:31.920 --> 13:33.240
My cards are just that good.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.040
Can't help it.

13:35.000 --> 13:35.670
You two

13:36.200 --> 13:38.390
just took the hits and didn't fight back.

13:38.390 --> 13:38.960
You two should've

13:38.960 --> 13:40.120
tried to block us.

13:40.320 --> 13:41.840
What? Are you addicted to losing?

13:41.840 --> 13:42.510
If I were you,

13:42.510 --> 13:43.910
I absolutely couldn't stand this.

13:43.910 --> 13:46.270
Settle card table grudges
at the card table.

13:46.270 --> 13:47.080
Let's keep playing.

13:47.080 --> 13:47.600
Come on.

13:51.510 --> 13:52.200
I'm tired.

13:52.320 --> 13:53.120
I need to rest.

13:54.360 --> 13:55.290
You're leaving?

13:57.030 --> 13:57.960
Really leaving?

13:58.270 --> 14:00.030
If you leave,
you can't win your money back!

14:00.030 --> 14:00.630
Having lost so much,

14:00.630 --> 14:02.430
can you two fall asleep tonight?

14:02.440 --> 14:03.600
Stop it.

14:12.480 --> 14:13.140
Senior Bai,

14:13.480 --> 14:14.360
I'm very sorry,

14:14.840 --> 14:16.240
but I have no choice.

14:16.910 --> 14:17.360
Look,

14:17.670 --> 14:18.600
if you live here,

14:18.630 --> 14:21.120
you have to travel between the outer
and inner courtyards every day.

14:21.120 --> 14:23.030
It's far and exhausting.

14:28.440 --> 14:30.640
You don't need to cultivate now anyway.

14:30.670 --> 14:31.600
This courtyard

14:31.850 --> 14:33.600
can't be used for the time being.

14:33.600 --> 14:35.000
How lonely it is living here solitarily.

14:35.000 --> 14:37.330
Why don't you eat and live

14:37.360 --> 14:38.360
with the outer courtyard disciples?

14:38.360 --> 14:39.360
It's more lively.

14:45.630 --> 14:46.290
Senior Bai,

14:47.030 --> 14:48.560
I'm just following orders.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.810
You should understand.

14:52.750 --> 14:54.150
Then I won't disturb you.

14:54.240 --> 14:55.300
I'll take my leave.

15:06.820 --> 15:09.090
[Baosu Courtyard]

15:17.240 --> 15:18.200
A bunch of snobs,

15:18.720 --> 15:19.550
bastards,

15:19.720 --> 15:20.720
and ingrates!

15:21.480 --> 15:22.960
When the Sect Leader finds out about this,

15:22.960 --> 15:24.020
you'll be done for!

15:25.320 --> 15:26.030
Senior Brother Bai,

15:26.030 --> 15:27.090
it's just ahead...

15:40.480 --> 15:41.240
Senior Brother Bai,

15:41.240 --> 15:42.030
I've always been looking forward

15:42.030 --> 15:43.090
to living with you.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.960
Actually, I think

15:45.030 --> 15:46.080
my poor cultivation

15:46.080 --> 15:47.810
isn't a matter of talent at all,

15:47.910 --> 15:50.030
but because no one has taught me properly.

15:50.030 --> 15:51.030
This is great now.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.720
From now on, I can just ask you directly

15:52.720 --> 15:54.980
if there's anything I don't understand.

15:56.630 --> 15:57.870
This is our room.

15:58.510 --> 15:59.490
Once we settle down,

15:59.490 --> 16:01.820
I'll show you around, Senior Brother Bai.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.120
Actually, living here

16:03.120 --> 16:04.190
has a lot of benefits.

16:04.190 --> 16:05.080
I will tell you all about them

16:05.080 --> 16:07.140
in detail later, Senior Brother Bai.

16:07.470 --> 16:08.730
Let's go inside first.

16:16.270 --> 16:17.120
Senior Brother Bai,

16:17.120 --> 16:17.790
here we are.

16:25.030 --> 16:25.750
Senior Bai?

16:26.290 --> 16:27.150
Why is he here?

16:27.440 --> 16:28.080
Yeah.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.740
Senior Brother Bai, this way.

16:32.230 --> 16:32.880
Senior Brother,

16:32.880 --> 16:33.810
I'll sleep here,

16:33.810 --> 16:35.340
and you can sleep next to me.

16:54.930 --> 16:56.570
I wonder why he's here.

16:57.890 --> 16:59.090
What happened to him?

17:59.110 --> 17:59.840
Here you are,

18:00.160 --> 18:01.220
freshly made buns.

18:02.030 --> 18:03.360
They smell super meaty.

18:03.590 --> 18:06.320
Your senior sister made them
especially for you.

18:12.590 --> 18:14.710
When I was young and wandering outside,

18:14.710 --> 18:16.910
I envied people with families the most.

18:17.720 --> 18:18.920
I really lucked out

18:19.160 --> 18:20.760
meeting your senior sister.

18:21.030 --> 18:21.790
I heard

18:22.460 --> 18:24.350
you also had a miserable childhood,

18:24.350 --> 18:25.480
lacked family ties,

18:25.840 --> 18:26.920
and suffered a lot.

18:27.750 --> 18:28.310
Before,

18:29.000 --> 18:30.330
you only had your master

18:30.590 --> 18:32.150
and your senior sister as family.

18:32.150 --> 18:32.950
In the future,

18:33.760 --> 18:34.890
you will have three.

18:42.750 --> 18:43.480
Give it a try.

18:43.990 --> 18:44.920
It's delicious.

19:14.830 --> 19:15.830
Maltose for sale!

19:15.830 --> 19:16.640
There are kites!

19:16.640 --> 19:18.640
Sweet and tasty, for all ages!

19:18.750 --> 19:20.640
Why are we shopping today?

19:21.270 --> 19:22.530
What do you want to buy?

19:22.790 --> 19:24.120
Today is a rare good day.

19:24.430 --> 19:25.670
Rising step by step!

19:25.690 --> 19:26.510
Buns!

19:26.880 --> 19:27.790
Hot buns!

19:28.070 --> 19:29.720
Freshly steamed big buns!

19:30.240 --> 19:30.790
Excuse me.

19:30.790 --> 19:31.920
How much for the buns?

19:31.920 --> 19:32.740
Eight wen each.

19:32.740 --> 19:33.650
Sir and madam, look,

19:33.650 --> 19:35.110
freshly steamed big buns.

19:36.070 --> 19:36.550
I'll get you one.

19:36.550 --> 19:37.030
Sorry.

19:37.050 --> 19:38.110
We don't want it now.

19:38.110 --> 19:38.510
Let's go.

19:38.510 --> 19:39.160
We're not eating this.

19:39.160 --> 19:39.720
Young lady,

19:39.720 --> 19:41.200
you're reluctant to even spend 8 wen?

19:41.200 --> 19:42.400
Why didn't you buy it?

19:42.790 --> 19:44.120
I didn't eat much today.

19:44.270 --> 19:45.000
I'm not full.

19:45.200 --> 19:47.200
We'll have something better later.

19:47.460 --> 19:49.060
Look, there's a tailor shop.

19:49.200 --> 19:50.800
Can you go take a look with me?

19:52.270 --> 19:53.730
Come with me to take a look.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.530
This one looks good.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.590
Do you like it?

19:59.270 --> 20:00.310
I have clothes to wear.

20:00.310 --> 20:01.640
No need to make new ones.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.550
Hello, sir and madam.

20:05.350 --> 20:06.470
When it comes to tailoring,

20:06.470 --> 20:08.060
our little shop is the best

20:08.080 --> 20:09.080
in the whole city.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.000
Then, sir,

20:10.160 --> 20:11.360
we'll try this one on.

20:11.680 --> 20:12.070
Okay.

20:12.630 --> 20:13.560
Just try it on.

20:19.180 --> 20:19.660
Okay.

20:36.020 --> 20:37.220
It looks really good.

20:37.640 --> 20:38.720
Full of nobility,

20:39.240 --> 20:40.570
handsome and reserved,

20:40.590 --> 20:42.020
you look exactly like a refined

20:42.020 --> 20:43.350
and elegant gentleman.

20:43.510 --> 20:44.640
If you could smile a bit,

20:44.640 --> 20:46.100
it would look even better.

20:49.600 --> 20:51.320
You don't like it?

20:52.480 --> 20:53.270
I like it.

20:54.010 --> 20:56.010
If I could eat something delicious,

20:56.280 --> 20:57.480
I'd like it even more.

21:05.450 --> 21:06.650
Vegetables here!

21:06.680 --> 21:07.920
Come and take a look!

21:08.180 --> 21:08.680
Thank you, sir.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.510
Fresh vegetables!

21:11.270 --> 21:11.930
Take a look!

21:12.680 --> 21:13.940
Let's go have some mutton soup!

21:13.940 --> 21:15.070
The sheep blood tofu stew here

21:15.070 --> 21:16.130
is very authentic.

21:16.720 --> 21:17.980
Let's look around a bit more.

21:17.980 --> 21:18.640
There's a shoe and hat shop

21:18.640 --> 21:19.790
up ahead that we haven't visited yet.

21:19.790 --> 21:20.920
Let's go take a look.

21:21.110 --> 21:22.170
It won't take long.

21:22.960 --> 21:23.890
It won't take long?

21:23.890 --> 21:25.020
Just a little while.

21:25.350 --> 21:25.880
Let's go.

21:27.400 --> 21:27.830
Sir,

21:28.230 --> 21:29.480
a bowl of mutton soup, please.

21:29.480 --> 21:30.410
Coming right up!

21:36.750 --> 21:38.550
How about this pair? Try them on.

22:11.440 --> 22:12.240
Xin Mei,

22:12.880 --> 22:14.720
I am
at the Foundation Establishment Stage now,

22:14.720 --> 22:16.720
with my stamina not as good as before.

22:16.720 --> 22:17.480
I know.

22:18.400 --> 22:19.440
Let's eat.

22:20.640 --> 22:21.500
Are you hungry?

22:22.390 --> 22:23.370
I'm almost starving to death!

22:23.370 --> 22:24.430
Aren't you hungry?

22:26.420 --> 22:28.480
Alright, then, let's go have dinner.

22:29.550 --> 22:30.080
Let's go.

22:30.430 --> 22:30.960
For real?

22:31.940 --> 22:35.960
[Tianxiang Restaurant]

22:32.550 --> 22:33.950
This is made of calfskin.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.170
It sounds crisp.

22:36.620 --> 22:37.420
You can try it.

22:39.440 --> 22:40.970
This is made of old cowhide.

22:41.590 --> 22:42.310
Are you sure

22:42.680 --> 22:43.880
this is a place to eat?

22:44.160 --> 22:44.720
Yes.

22:45.560 --> 22:46.030
This one, this one!

22:46.030 --> 22:46.400
Let's go.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.400
This one is cheap.

23:18.890 --> 23:20.200
-Happy birthday!
-Happy birthday.

23:19.140 --> 23:23.140
♪ Caught in fate's design,
I search my soul ♪

23:20.500 --> 23:21.370
Sir, wish you

23:21.400 --> 23:22.400
all the best!

23:22.880 --> 23:23.790
Wish you peace all year round

23:23.520 --> 23:26.500
♪ What should I do to avoid
living my life in vain? ♪

23:23.960 --> 23:25.110
and good fortune as always!

23:25.110 --> 23:26.200
Wish you great wealth

23:26.200 --> 23:27.310
and robust health!

23:26.520 --> 23:28.250
♪ My blade stays clean,
untouched by dust ♪

23:27.830 --> 23:29.590
Wish you smooth sailing in everything.

23:28.270 --> 23:32.240
♪ Yet it's sparked thousands of wars ♪

23:33.640 --> 23:34.380
Wish you wealth and fortune.

23:34.380 --> 23:37.430
♪ A towering tree worn down into
a blade devoid of feeling ♪

23:35.510 --> 23:36.640
Wish you longevity.

23:37.350 --> 23:38.310
Wish you joyful years ahead.

23:37.860 --> 23:41.110
♪ The heart hides its root
at the bottom of the abyss ♪

23:39.110 --> 23:41.110
-Happy birthday.
-Happy birthday.

23:41.390 --> 23:47.300
♪ In red, I look at you
with a glimpse of shame ♪

23:48.010 --> 23:51.820
♪ Being haunted by the spell,
even if it's cruel ♪

23:48.550 --> 23:49.210
Time to eat.

23:52.340 --> 23:55.180
♪ It's better than being trapped by fate ♪

23:55.340 --> 23:57.080
♪ Between gain and loss ♪

23:57.110 --> 24:01.320
♪ Lies a thousand years of grace ♪

24:03.400 --> 24:06.440
♪ Even if it's soul-eroding,
collarbone-binding pain, I accept it all ♪

24:04.960 --> 24:06.490
Didn't you say before that,

24:06.920 --> 24:07.830
after finishing the fate

24:07.140 --> 24:10.440
♪ Embracing pain as home,
reborn like a phoenix ♪

24:07.830 --> 24:09.110
of Curse of Five Deficiencies,

24:09.110 --> 24:10.770
you could have the finest wine

24:10.930 --> 24:16.990
♪ Just to trade the rest of my days
for one true life as a human ♪

24:11.510 --> 24:13.040
and the most delicious food

24:13.440 --> 24:15.770
in the biggest restaurant in the capital?

24:16.080 --> 24:17.080
It's not

24:17.110 --> 24:18.400
completely over yet,

24:18.240 --> 24:21.190
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

24:19.510 --> 24:21.110
and we're not in the capital,

24:21.390 --> 24:24.450
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

24:22.590 --> 24:24.120
but today is your birthday.

24:24.480 --> 24:27.300
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

24:26.070 --> 24:27.550
So I prepared this on my own.

24:27.330 --> 24:31.920
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

24:32.210 --> 24:35.810
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

24:35.840 --> 24:39.000
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

24:36.920 --> 24:39.200
Wish you flourish like flowers and leaves,

24:39.200 --> 24:41.020
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

24:39.510 --> 24:41.040
enjoying the gentle spring wind

24:41.040 --> 24:46.390
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

24:41.160 --> 24:42.270
every year,

24:43.310 --> 24:45.370
always smiling in the spring breeze;

24:45.960 --> 24:48.510
and wish you longevity.

24:46.870 --> 24:50.520
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

24:50.550 --> 24:53.600
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

24:53.620 --> 24:56.420
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

24:56.440 --> 25:00.980
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

25:01.270 --> 25:05.030
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

25:04.790 --> 25:05.310
Thank you.

25:05.050 --> 25:07.990
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

25:08.350 --> 25:10.390
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

25:10.420 --> 25:15.450
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

25:15.480 --> 25:21.530
♪ Don't live in vain,
have a pleasant journey of life ♪

25:45.880 --> 25:47.740
Senior Brother Bai, are you okay?

25:50.960 --> 25:51.560
Yuanfeng,

25:51.720 --> 25:52.440
what's wrong with you?

25:52.440 --> 25:53.270
Are you blind?

25:53.680 --> 25:54.070
What?

25:54.310 --> 25:55.240
What's going on?

25:55.350 --> 25:56.480
Isn't it Senior Bai?

25:57.000 --> 25:58.460
Why are you sweeping here?

26:01.360 --> 26:03.020
Senior Brother Bai, let's go.

26:08.590 --> 26:09.510
Senior Bai.

26:10.210 --> 26:11.500
Since returning to the mountain last time,

26:11.500 --> 26:13.300
I haven't had a chance to see you.

26:14.590 --> 26:15.830
How is your recovery?

26:17.590 --> 26:18.070
Not bad.

26:19.840 --> 26:20.570
That's good.

26:22.960 --> 26:24.090
You may not know that

26:24.680 --> 26:25.550
the sword-controlling technique

26:25.550 --> 26:26.810
you are practicing now

26:27.070 --> 26:28.800
was what our Senior Brother Bai

26:29.410 --> 26:30.920
mastered immediately

26:30.920 --> 26:32.430
after hearing the Sect Master

26:32.430 --> 26:33.830
recite the incantation.

26:34.550 --> 26:35.680
Your comprehension

26:36.120 --> 26:37.160
is far worse

26:38.510 --> 26:40.030
than Senior Brother Bai's.

26:40.030 --> 26:41.750
Since we happened to meet him today,

26:41.750 --> 26:42.810
why don't you hurry

26:42.830 --> 26:45.360
and ask Senior Brother Bai
for advice humbly?

26:45.960 --> 26:47.160
If you miss it today,

26:47.920 --> 26:49.160
you might regret it.

26:49.550 --> 26:50.610
I was just thinking

26:50.890 --> 26:51.680
that the elegant posture

26:51.680 --> 26:53.310
when Senior Brother Bai dodged

26:53.310 --> 26:54.640
my flying sword just now

26:54.790 --> 26:56.030
is as good as before.

26:56.350 --> 26:58.000
Seems like he had expected it.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.350
My skills are not good enough.

26:59.350 --> 27:02.150
Hope Senior Brother Bai
can give me some guidance.

27:06.960 --> 27:07.620
Look, guys.

27:08.350 --> 27:09.920
Senior Brother Bai's eyes

27:10.030 --> 27:11.690
contain infinite sword will.

27:12.000 --> 27:13.920
They seem to exude
a chilling killing intent

27:13.920 --> 27:15.480
that can hurt people invisibly.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.410
It makes one feel

27:17.070 --> 27:19.330
a chill down the spine just looking at it.

27:21.880 --> 27:22.720
Senior Bai,

27:23.590 --> 27:24.780
are you ignoring me?

27:25.460 --> 27:27.200
You used to be busy with cultivation,

27:27.200 --> 27:28.930
so we didn't dare to bother you.

27:29.110 --> 27:30.770
But what are you busy with now?

27:31.160 --> 27:32.310
Is sweeping the floor

27:32.310 --> 27:33.440
really that urgent?

27:33.720 --> 27:34.650
Shut your mouth!

27:35.920 --> 27:36.750
Listen,

27:37.030 --> 27:38.130
this is none of your business.

27:38.130 --> 27:39.240
Get lost.

27:39.270 --> 27:41.000
You want some guidance, right?

27:41.190 --> 27:41.750
Yes,

27:42.070 --> 27:44.280
I hope you can enlighten me,
Senior Brother Bai.

27:44.280 --> 27:44.680
Okay.

27:45.250 --> 27:45.710
Yuanqi,

27:46.440 --> 27:48.640
would you dare to spar with him for a bit?

27:49.830 --> 27:50.750
Why wouldn't I?

28:01.590 --> 28:02.990
He's at the 5th level
of Qi Refining stage,

28:02.990 --> 28:04.440
while you're at the 3rd level.

28:04.440 --> 28:05.160
Even though he has started

28:05.160 --> 28:06.240
practicing the sword-controlling technique

28:06.240 --> 28:07.170
and you haven't,

28:07.350 --> 28:09.310
in terms of spiritual power and skills,

28:09.310 --> 28:11.840
there's actually
no huge gap between you two.

28:21.240 --> 28:22.240
Don't be nervous.

28:22.590 --> 28:24.790
He's more afraid of losing than you are.

28:27.110 --> 28:27.710
Remember,

28:28.110 --> 28:28.720
in a fight,

28:29.270 --> 28:30.310
once you create distance,

28:30.310 --> 28:31.590
you'll stand no chance of winning.

28:31.590 --> 28:32.640
Only in close combat

28:32.640 --> 28:33.840
can you have a chance.

28:35.200 --> 28:36.680
Which sword technique have you

28:36.680 --> 28:37.810
practiced the best?

28:38.000 --> 28:40.000
Does the starting technique count?

28:40.030 --> 28:40.480
Yes.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.880
Use the starting technique to beat him.

29:08.000 --> 29:08.480
Yuanqi,

29:09.240 --> 29:10.030
what ultimate move on earth

29:10.030 --> 29:11.430
did Senior Bai teach you?

29:11.480 --> 29:12.510
Show me

29:12.750 --> 29:13.960
and broaden my horizons.

29:13.960 --> 29:16.110
Only in close combat
can you have a chance.

29:16.110 --> 29:18.240
Don't try to defeat the rival quickly.

29:18.290 --> 29:19.790
Just disrupt his footwork,

29:19.790 --> 29:21.310
so he can't focus
on controlling his sword.

29:21.310 --> 29:23.160
Once you feel his qi to control the sword,

29:23.160 --> 29:24.890
that means you're going to win.

29:36.350 --> 29:36.830
Yuanqi!

29:38.720 --> 29:39.200
Yuanqi!

29:39.680 --> 29:40.140
Come on.

29:41.720 --> 29:42.240
Yuanqi.

29:43.160 --> 29:43.750
Senior.

29:44.720 --> 29:45.640
Sima Randeng!

29:46.240 --> 29:48.170
I was just teaching him some rules.

29:48.440 --> 29:49.790
Yuanfeng is his senior.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.490
Disrespecting a senior

29:51.590 --> 29:52.720
deserves a beating.

29:54.960 --> 29:56.690
Senior Bai is also your senior.

29:56.880 --> 29:57.590
Being so disrespectful

29:57.590 --> 29:58.790
and arrogant and talking improperly

29:58.790 --> 29:59.650
in front of him,

30:00.160 --> 30:01.820
do you deserve a beating, too?

30:02.440 --> 30:04.530
Senior Jiang,
you are from Lingji Mountain.

30:04.530 --> 30:05.350
Why are you staying

30:05.350 --> 30:07.080
at our Tianyuan Sect every day?

30:07.270 --> 30:08.200
I want to be here.

30:08.510 --> 30:10.040
It's none of your business.

30:10.840 --> 30:11.570
Why don't you

30:12.310 --> 30:13.570
teach me a lesson, too?

30:13.640 --> 30:14.070
You...

30:17.110 --> 30:18.550
You got me wrong, Senior Jiang.

30:18.550 --> 30:19.510
I'm just worried

30:19.720 --> 30:21.510
that there are many sect affairs
in Lingji Mountain

30:21.510 --> 30:22.970
waiting for you to handle.

30:23.090 --> 30:24.150
It's not your place

30:24.800 --> 30:25.880
to drive me away.

30:27.480 --> 30:28.010
Alright.

30:28.880 --> 30:30.010
That's it for today.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.150
Let's go back.

30:32.150 --> 30:32.550
Yes.

30:33.440 --> 30:33.900
Come on.

30:45.720 --> 30:47.850
I haven't seen you these past few days.

30:47.880 --> 30:49.880
I thought you had already gone back.

30:52.800 --> 30:53.420
The past few days,

30:53.420 --> 30:54.880
I went to Tianyin Mountain

30:55.130 --> 30:56.160
and asked Grand Master Lingxu

30:56.160 --> 30:57.220
for some medicine.

30:57.350 --> 30:59.110
Then I went to Taishan Cave, too.

30:59.110 --> 31:01.750
This is the 100-Rotation Pill
from Tianyin Mountain.

31:01.750 --> 31:03.480
It can restore your meridians.

31:03.590 --> 31:05.160
This is the Bone-Purifying Pill,

31:05.160 --> 31:07.220
which can strengthen your physique.

31:08.480 --> 31:09.510
This is Jade-Dew Nourishing Ginseng

31:09.510 --> 31:10.570
from Taishan Cave.

31:10.790 --> 31:11.830
They won't help.

31:13.200 --> 31:15.000
You haven't even tried them yet.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.930
How can you say they won't help?

31:17.270 --> 31:18.110
You know it.

31:19.070 --> 31:20.000
They won't work.

31:23.270 --> 31:24.330
You should go back.

31:28.160 --> 31:29.090
Go back to where?

31:29.590 --> 31:30.590
Back to your sect,

31:31.070 --> 31:32.070
Lingji Mountain.

31:35.590 --> 31:36.450
What about you?

31:37.200 --> 31:37.790
Me?

31:43.070 --> 31:44.230
Where else can I go?

31:46.200 --> 31:47.660
Of course, I'll stay here.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.030
Stay here for what?

31:50.000 --> 31:51.600
Wait to be bullied by others?

31:53.590 --> 31:55.390
It's fine if you want me to leave.

31:56.030 --> 31:57.560
But you have to come with me.

31:59.140 --> 32:00.140
Go with you?

32:00.440 --> 32:00.880
Yes.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.950
If you are willing to,

32:03.200 --> 32:05.350
we can go back
to Lingji Mountain together.

32:05.350 --> 32:06.240
If not,

32:06.960 --> 32:08.160
the world is so big,

32:09.000 --> 32:10.260
and we can go anywhere.

32:15.200 --> 32:15.860
Senior Bai,

32:17.350 --> 32:18.610
after all these years,

32:19.000 --> 32:20.350
you know very well

32:22.070 --> 32:23.200
what's in my mind.

32:24.920 --> 32:26.650
Given the way you are right now,

32:27.150 --> 32:28.030
how could I possibly

32:28.030 --> 32:29.440
leave you behind?

32:47.100 --> 32:51.040
♪ Honor and disgrace;
rumors and prejudice ♪

32:48.440 --> 32:49.240
We can never be

32:50.920 --> 32:51.830
in a relationship.

32:51.830 --> 32:55.230
♪ Everyone has their own take ♪

32:53.960 --> 32:54.790
Why?

32:55.870 --> 32:59.690
♪ Fingers coated in blood
and disasters brought about ♪

32:57.480 --> 32:58.030
I don't care

32:58.030 --> 32:59.310
if you are a cultivator or not.

32:59.310 --> 33:00.070
But I care.

32:59.720 --> 33:02.950
♪ Were never what I wanted ♪

33:01.790 --> 33:03.240
Even if I still had
my immortal perception,

33:03.240 --> 33:07.080
♪ The great way is fading away,
besieged by mysterious traps ♪

33:04.640 --> 33:06.370
we still wouldn't be together.

33:07.350 --> 33:08.590
Because I don't like you.

33:07.950 --> 33:11.700
♪ Who dares to treat life and death
as nothing? ♪

33:10.920 --> 33:11.730
I don't believe it.

33:11.730 --> 33:15.450
♪ In the blink of an eye, the body
collapses, and the soul is destroyed ♪

33:12.960 --> 33:14.690
You are saying this on purpose.

33:15.110 --> 33:16.310
You just want to drive me away.

33:15.470 --> 33:20.450
♪ The fire starts raging across the land ♪

33:21.220 --> 33:23.260
♪ What do you think is ♪

33:23.290 --> 33:25.570
♪ The most impressive farewell
in the world? ♪

33:24.110 --> 33:24.790
It's unnecessary for me

33:24.790 --> 33:26.160
to lie about such things.

33:25.940 --> 33:29.070
♪ The endless slaughter and massacres ♪

33:26.920 --> 33:27.780
I think there's

33:28.750 --> 33:29.400
a woman

33:29.480 --> 33:30.830
I love in my heart.

33:29.910 --> 33:33.860
♪ Do not wait until that thin snow
on the eaves ♪

33:32.350 --> 33:33.280
But it's not you.

33:33.880 --> 33:37.110
♪ Turns a young man's hair white
before you regret it ♪

33:36.030 --> 33:37.160
I can't respond

33:37.670 --> 33:39.400
♪ When do you think ♪

33:38.830 --> 33:40.110
to your deep feelings.

33:39.430 --> 33:41.860
♪ The bloody strife will come to an end? ♪

33:41.880 --> 33:45.210
♪ Burn myself to prove it
without looking back ♪

33:43.830 --> 33:44.430
I'm sorry.

33:45.760 --> 33:49.730
♪ Holding the morning glow in hand,
I paint the world ♪

33:49.760 --> 33:55.720
♪ The dawn light
illuminates the vast sky ♪

33:55.750 --> 33:57.310
♪ What do you think is ♪

33:57.360 --> 33:59.650
♪ The most impressive farewell
in the world? ♪

33:59.830 --> 34:02.960
♪ The endless slaughter and massacres ♪

34:03.800 --> 34:07.750
♪ Do not wait until that thin snow
on the eaves ♪

34:07.780 --> 34:11.010
♪ Turns a young man's hair white
before you regret it ♪

34:11.560 --> 34:13.300
♪ When do you think ♪

34:13.320 --> 34:15.760
♪ The bloody strife will come to an end? ♪

34:15.780 --> 34:18.760
♪ End these everlasting battles ♪

34:19.630 --> 34:23.570
♪ Holding the morning glow in hand,
I paint the world ♪

34:23.699 --> 34:27.980
♪ Someone's got to clean up this mess ♪

34:24.550 --> 34:25.150
Thank you.

34:26.150 --> 34:27.150
Everything's here.

34:27.150 --> 34:27.610
Come on.

34:29.320 --> 34:30.510
I don't want to stay with him,

34:30.510 --> 34:32.190
nor do I want to travel with him.

34:32.190 --> 34:32.650
What...

34:34.840 --> 34:35.280
Sheng.

34:36.110 --> 34:37.920
The "Unparalleled Secret Magic" is
of great importance.

34:37.920 --> 34:39.989
I'm afraid we'll encounter danger
on the way.

34:39.989 --> 34:40.949
Didn't we agree

34:41.130 --> 34:42.190
to split into two groups?

34:42.190 --> 34:43.710
Even if something happens to one group,

34:43.710 --> 34:45.310
the other can arrive safely.

34:46.000 --> 34:46.460
Then why

34:46.469 --> 34:47.670
can't we be in one group,

34:47.670 --> 34:49.400
and let him go with Lu Qianqiao?

34:49.760 --> 34:51.570
Qianqiao's cultivation realm has dropped

34:51.570 --> 34:53.090
to the Foundation Establishment Stage.

34:53.090 --> 34:53.790
And Lord of Rust-Sword

34:53.790 --> 34:54.920
isn't a cultivator.

34:55.110 --> 34:56.440
If immortal sects come to stop them,

34:56.440 --> 34:58.640
they'll definitely be in grave danger.

34:59.070 --> 35:00.000
What do you mean?

35:00.550 --> 35:02.280
Are you doubting my capabilities?

35:02.280 --> 35:03.320
Then why can't Zuo Yingying

35:03.320 --> 35:04.150
go with them?

35:04.550 --> 35:05.880
Why does it have to be me?

35:06.800 --> 35:08.230
I'm not going to the Central Plains.

35:08.230 --> 35:09.760
It has nothing to do with me.

35:11.590 --> 35:12.630
My dear Sheng,

35:13.030 --> 35:13.760
there's really

35:13.760 --> 35:15.020
no other way this time.

35:15.070 --> 35:16.480
Sorry to put you through this.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.210
Can you do it?

35:27.710 --> 35:29.170
Why hasn't Lu come out yet?

35:33.600 --> 35:37.750
[Tomb of Duan Xianyin, my dear master]

36:05.760 --> 36:06.150
Done?

36:07.440 --> 36:07.840
Done.

36:09.000 --> 36:09.460
Come on.

36:11.510 --> 36:12.040
Let's go!

36:28.480 --> 36:30.960
Even a 1,000-mile journey
with friends ends in farewell.

36:30.960 --> 36:32.630
Let's part ways here.

36:32.880 --> 36:34.240
You keep saying you're leaving.

36:34.240 --> 36:35.440
So where are you going?

36:35.440 --> 36:36.900
Going back to my hometown.

36:37.020 --> 36:37.960
Didn't you say you grew up

36:37.960 --> 36:39.160
in the Qinghong Sect?

36:39.280 --> 36:41.080
You know where your hometown is?

36:41.440 --> 36:42.100
Yes, I know.

36:43.030 --> 36:43.840
He told me.

36:50.590 --> 36:52.280
There are two routes back to the capital.

36:52.280 --> 36:54.230
The western one goes through Xutuo City

36:54.230 --> 36:55.090
and is shorter.

36:55.670 --> 36:57.830
The eastern one goes through the desert,

36:57.830 --> 36:59.070
but it's sparsely populated

36:59.070 --> 37:00.150
and inconspicuous,

37:00.150 --> 37:01.550
so it's relatively safe.

37:02.360 --> 37:03.880
Remember to write when you get home.

37:03.880 --> 37:05.540
Just send it to Safe Haven Inn.

37:05.590 --> 37:06.650
We will receive it.

37:07.150 --> 37:07.630
Got it.

37:08.850 --> 37:09.540
Take care.

37:11.590 --> 37:13.050
Take care on your journey.

37:49.280 --> 37:50.740
Xutuo City is right ahead.

37:51.200 --> 37:51.810
Past that,

37:51.840 --> 37:52.610
there will be no suitable

37:52.610 --> 37:53.940
places to rest and stay.

37:54.050 --> 37:55.110
Let's go to the city

37:55.150 --> 37:56.810
and stock up on food and water.

37:57.550 --> 37:58.080
Alright.

37:58.620 --> 38:00.280
You're always so thoughtful.

38:11.190 --> 38:13.750
[Tianyuan Sect]

38:17.880 --> 38:20.080
Mo Guan's injuries have mostly healed.

38:20.190 --> 38:21.190
In about 10 days,

38:21.440 --> 38:22.970
he will be fully recovered.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.660
Senior, please have some tea.

38:25.960 --> 38:27.670
How are things going in North Xiang?

38:27.670 --> 38:29.600
We have sent out quite a few scouts.

38:29.620 --> 38:31.230
Once they come out of the Liubo Temple,

38:31.230 --> 38:33.090
they will get messages sent back.

38:36.880 --> 38:37.610
Sect Leader,

38:37.760 --> 38:39.560
there's a confidential letter.

38:44.500 --> 38:45.690
[Lu Qianqiao and the others have left
North Xiang in 2 groups for the capital.]

38:45.690 --> 38:46.880
[Lu Qianqiao and Xin Mei went west.]

38:48.550 --> 38:49.750
They're coming back.

38:53.950 --> 38:56.880
[Xutuo City]

38:56.930 --> 39:02.480
[Caiyuan Inn]

39:09.710 --> 39:10.480
Do you think

39:10.710 --> 39:11.630
the immortal sect in the Central Plains

39:11.630 --> 39:12.960
that Qinghong Sect colluded with

39:12.960 --> 39:14.360
could be Zigai Mountain?

39:15.590 --> 39:16.140
Why?

39:16.920 --> 39:18.250
They are short of money.

39:20.000 --> 39:21.490
But it doesn't seem like them.

39:21.490 --> 39:22.630
They probably wouldn't dare to offend

39:22.630 --> 39:25.490
Lingji Mountain and Tianyuan Sect
at the same time.

39:25.550 --> 39:26.840
What if it's Tianyuan Sect?
